  "name": "tsuzuri",
  "description": "A modular Rust framework designed for Event Sourcing and CQRS architectures, emphasizing type-safe domain-driven design and high-performance state management. It provides a core set of abstractions for aggregate roots, command handlers, and event journals, alongside production-ready persistence adapters for AWS DynamoDB and LibSQL. The framework natively supports advanced features such as snapshotting for performance optimization, inverted indexing for discovery, and integration with AWS Kinesis and DynamoDB Streams for downstream projection processing.",
